  "why": "Please Excuse My Younger Brothers (Uchi no Otouto-domo ga Sumimasen) is a 24 episode run that began 2026-07-04 and is scheduled to end 2026-12-11, so it is halfway through a two cour broadcast; AniList, Kitsu, MyAnimeList and the offline row all give episodeCount 24 and a 2026-07-04 start. anizip:19755 is the same run: it carries first-party SAME_AS handles to mal:63061 and anilist:203490, its episodeCount is 24, and its episode 1 releases 2026-07-03T15:00Z, the 2026-07-04 premiere in Japan time. cr:GT00371926-GS00371927 is the same run: anilist:203490 itself declares SAME_AS against it, it is the Crunchyroll season under the series please-excuse-my-younger-brothers, and the 11 episodes it lists (a partial listing of the 24, not a fold, since its last episode is 2026-09-11 and the run continues to December) sit on the same eleven dates as AniZip's episodes 1 to 11 with seven titles character for character identical. Those 11 Crunchyroll episodes pair with AniZip episodes 1 to 11 on those dates, every one the same calendar day. jw:510257-553374 is the same run: it is the JustWatch season at the slug please-excuse-my-younger-brothers, it carries first-party SAME_AS handles to anilist:203490, anizip:19755, kitsu:50797, mal:63061 and offline:mal-63061, and its first ten episode titles are character for character the Crunchyroll titles at the same numbers. Those ten pair with Crunchyroll episodes 1 to 10 on those titles; JustWatch's eleventh entry is the placeholder Episode 11 and is left unpaired. cr:GT00371926 holds the run: it is the bare Crunchyroll series container (scope CONTAINER, no dates, no episodes, no count) and kitsu:50797 declares PART_OF against it, with no includes range since it lists nothing to align. nf:82941827-1 is left unsettled: it is titled Please Excuse My Younger Brothers and claims SAME_AS against every member, but it carries no dates, its episodeCount of 11 is neither the run's 24 nor anything the row itself explains, and ten of its eleven episodes are named Episode 2 to Episode 11."
